<title>USA: Ethan Allen increases repurchase program.</title>
<headline>Ethan Allen increases repurchase program.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ethan Allen Interiors Inc said its board has approved an increase in the company's repurchase program by an additional 500,000 shares.</p>
<p>Earlier the board approved an increase in its quarterly dividend to $0.06 a share.</p>
</text>
